- RedstoneTorchBlock.tick: PROPAGATES — toggles based on power below,
  triggers cascade updates
- DiodeBlock.tick (covers Repeater): DEFERRED — outputs change next tick
  per repeater delay semantics
- ObserverBlock.tick: PROPAGATES — toggles powered + reschedules self
- ComparatorBlock.tick: DEFERRED — reads back container, writes BE state

Total annotations: 56 (up from 52). Per arch §14.2 DG1 redstone target ~50;
core components now covered. Pistons (multi-block updates with movement
sub-DAG) deferred to a separate batch.

